	'ka5a4c49e' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder (05) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Fitting day',
	'ka6e85a60' => '21+ seats',
	'ka7582417' => 'Talk to us.',
	'ka78ec776' => 'Our first production allocation of 400 machines remains on schedule to begin shipping from March 2027. If you submitted a preorder deposit of €200, your allocation is formally secured and your deposit remains refundable at any point before delivery date confirmation. If you have immediate questions about counter specifications or need to update your kitchen details, reach our Rotterdam workshop team at hello@susugiwash.example or call +31 10 000 0000 during weekday business hours.',
	'ka7e9f057' => 'Descaler cartridges come in packs of six for €38. Your fitter shows you how to change one on fitting day and sets the built-in softener to your local water hardness before the test cycles.',
	'ka9eed792' => 'The five-year care plan costs €180 and covers preventative maintenance inspections and component replacements. It can be added to your order at any time.',
	'kabaf4a08' => '1.5 m',
	'kac386939' => 'Which model suits a ten-seat kitchen?',
	'kacbc83c5' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Support (03) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Care and parts',
	'kad49a37a' => '400×400 mm',
	'kada96fd5' => 'Before and after.',
	'kae289deb' => 'Founded 2023 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Werfstraat 12, Rotterdam',
	'kae28a468' => 'Support by phone and email, Monday to Friday, CET.',
	'kae4ee459' => 'Not sure',
	'kaefaaf46' => '820 mm',
	'kaf1ead57' => 'All listed prices are stated in EUR and include VAT. The Susugi Wash 45 is priced at €1,890, while the larger Susugi Wash 60 is priced at €2,290. Professional fitting day costs €240 and includes one fitter for about four hours to complete water, drain, and electrical checks alongside cycle commissioning. Additional rack sets containing one glass rack, one plate rack, and a cutlery basket are €95. A pack of six descaler cartridges is €38, and our comprehensive five-year care plan is €180.',
	'kaf4f72b5' => 'Before installation day, we review four specific physical conditions during your video consultation. Your counter clearance must provide a minimum height of 830 mm from finished floor to the underside of the worktop. You will need an isolated cold water supply terminating in a standard three-quarter-inch connection, a wastewater drain connection located within 1.5 metres of the machine, and an earthed 230 V 16 A electrical socket. If your space satisfies these four conditions, the machine slides directly into place with zero structural alteration or joinery modification.',
	'kb1e66745' => '45 cm',
	'kb1ec2b58' => 'One fitter.<br>One morning.',
	'kb28ab94c' => 'Does it need an extraction hood?',
	'kb29f82b4' => 'Seats',
	'kb3767300' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder &nbsp;/&nbsp; The last rack',
	'kb576fdc1' => 'machines in the first batch',
	'kb6af8ae4' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Fitting day (02) &nbsp;/&nbsp; What we check',
	'kb6fd31d4' => 'What goes through it.',
	'kb7c045a3' => 'Door at knee height.',
	'kb7f3e46e' => '45 or 60.<br>Both fit under 820 mm.',
	'kb863a074' => 'Earthed socket within reach of the machine.',
	'kb88f7ca1' => 'Both the 45 and 60 models stand 820 mm tall and need a finished counter clearance of at least 830 mm. If your counter measures less, our fitters cannot complete installation. We verify your exact clearance during the advance video check.',
	'kb976520e' => 'Reserve your Susugi Wash with a refundable deposit. We produce machines in scheduled production batches with transparent pricing across Europe.',
	'kba4a80c8' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder (07) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Specs and prices',
	'kbaed2a45' => 'Designed specifically for ten-seat kitchens, Susugi Wash fits standard undercounter spaces while washing a complete rack in ninety seconds. Two widths share identical rinse temperatures, soft-closing hinges, and built-in water treatment.',
	'kbb6c1a5a' => 'Can I cancel my preorder and receive a full deposit refund?',
	'kbcaeba43' => 'Advance site check',
	'kbcc254b5' => 'Phone',
	'kbd33d1ce' => '(—) Terms',
	'kbd583e2f' => 'First service with the fitter on call.',
	'kbe0ae9b7' => 'At 22:00, the final table settles their bill, the music lowers, and the cooks wipe down the cutting boards. What remains is the silent weight of the night: rows of wine glasses, stacks of sauce-stained ceramic plates, and heavy prep containers clustered around the sink. In a compact dining room, there is nowhere to hide dirty dishware; every unwashed glass sits in plain view of the empty counter.',
	'kbe2bf5a2' => '(10) Notes',
	'kbe75b515' => 'Workshop Location and Operating Schedule',
	'kbea267ee' => 'Yes, your €200 deposit is completely refundable at any moment prior to your shipping date confirmation. If your kitchen layout changes or the video site check reveals that your counter height or plumbing supply is unsuitable, simply notify our support team by email. We process the refund immediately to your original payment method without deduction or administrative fee. Furthermore, every completed installation comes with a 30-day return period following fitting day, allowing you to trial the machine in active service.',
	'kbeb810ba' => '(02) In the workshop',
	'kbee94c82' => '(04) On the bench',
	'kbf2963f7' => 'Jun carries out morning installations and levelling, and sets the water softener to match local water hardness before the test cycles run.',
	'kc05d3514' => 'Installation Scope and Thirty-Day Return Rights',
	'kc0a6cab3' => '(—) Privacy',
	'kc0f1bd91' => 'Experienced Technical Fitters on Site',
	'kc1680cc0' => '(02) The last hour',
	'kc1e8612e' => '(09) Contact',
	'kc24a02a5' => 'Signing up for our early-access waitlist ensures you receive timely notices as manufacturing milestones are reached. Waitlist members receive three specific benefits: direct alerts on upcoming production batch releases, advance booking windows for morning fitting slots in your metropolitan area, and a single informative update email each month without marketing noise. When regional installation routes are planned, kitchens on our waitlist receive seventy-two hours of priority scheduling before public dates are released.',
	'kc397d6c0' => 'Drain pump, softener',
	'kc3c0fc18' => '600 mm',
	'kc4c53385' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder (04) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Two sizes',
	'kc68c1f0b' => 'In twenty minutes we look at your counter height, cold water, drain and socket together on screen.',
	'kc7251477' => 'The Susugi Wash 45 (448 mm wide, 400 by 400 mm rack) suits a counter of about ten seats. The 60 (598 mm wide, 500 by 500 mm rack, Gastronorm 1/1) suits twelve seats and up, or heavier pan work. If you are unsure, choose “not sure” on the waitlist and a fitter will help during the video check.',
	'kc74988e3' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder (03) &nbsp;/&nbsp; What goes through it',
	'kc82a6ac8' => '448 × 560 × 820 mm (W × D × H)',
	'kc86b1667' => 'Two Models Sized for Compact Workstations',
	'kc9eba96b' => 'Reservation Schedule and Deposit Terms',
	'kcb66dd12' => 'Glasses, straight off the rack',
	'kccb636b7' => 'Susugi Wash B.V. operates from our assembly facility located at Werfstraat 12, 3011 Rotterdam, Netherlands. General inquiries and technical assistance are managed via email at hello@susugiwash.example or by phone at +31 10 000 0000. Customer support is staffed Monday through Friday between 08:00 and 18:00 CET. Morning fitting appointments take place Monday through Saturday from 06:30 to 11:00, timed specifically to commission machines and complete safety checks prior to kitchen lunch service.',
	'kce3804e0' => 'Machine and Accessory Price List',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kce969fe5' => 'Susugi Wash 60 (598 mm wide)',
	'kceace2fe' => '(02) The machine',
	'kd065a13f' => 'At Comptoir Lea, we serve ten guests along our counter every night. The 45 cm machine fits neatly beside our prep station. Instead of letting wine glasses accumulate until midnight, we run two quick racks during service and leave immediately after dessert.',
	'kd0b41489' => 'The technical specification prioritises commercial durability and minimal resource use. Water consumption is 2.4 litres per cycle on the 45 model and 3.1 litres on the 60 model, with both machines finishing every cycle with an 82 degrees Celsius sanitising final rinse. Operating noise remains at 52 dB(A). Electrical requirements are straightforward: the 45 connects to a single-phase 230 V 16 A socket, while the 60 runs on either 230 V 16 A or 400 V three-phase power. Each unit features built-in water softeners and commercial drain pumps designed for immediate connection to existing lines.',
