	'ke1f57d0c' => '24 hours',
	'ke2775107' => 'One door, one dial',
	'ke31ae977' => '(01) Before you buy',
	'ke391c4d3' => 'Four engineering choices define the daily operation of every Susugi Wash machine. First, the standard wash cycle completes in ninety seconds, with a three-minute heavy programme for baked pans. Second, an internal drain pump and integrated water softener eliminate the need for external booster boxes or standpipes. Third, the counterbalanced front door sits at knee height with a soft-closing friction hinge that drops smoothly without slamming against floor tiles. Fourth, acoustic dampening around the pump enclosure maintains operational noise at fifty-two decibels, allowing calm dining room conversations just two paces from the pass.',
	'ke3c9044f' => 'Four-hour morning fitting',
	'ke491d451' => 'That page is not here. The machine, the fitting day and the preorder are one step away.',
	'ke4f39f7a' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Contact (02) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Visiting',
	'ke5327bbb' => 'I agree to the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.',
	'ke59f5df7' => 'Who services the machine and provides spare parts?',
	'ke5a218f2' => 'Your data,<br>handled with care.',
	'ke5e5eb15' => '(01) Early access',
	'ke638903e' => 'Water per cycle',
	'ke7ee332f' => '(08) Support & FAQ',
	'ke80ca477' => 'A cold water supply with a three-quarter-inch connection, a drain within 1.5 metres and an earthed 230 V 16 A socket. The 60 can also run on 400 V three-phase. The fitter checks all of this, plus the 830 mm clearance, in the twenty-minute video site check.',
	'ke8f2d4fb' => 'Chef-Owner, Comptoir Lea, Lyon',
	'ke952914d' => 'How do I descale the machine?',
	'ke96c11ba' => 'Technical Specifications and Utility Connections',
	'kea601ad3' => 'What the kitchen looks like once the fitter has gone.',
	'kea912152' => 'Preorders for the Susugi Wash 45 at €1,890 and the Susugi Wash 60 at €2,290 require a €200 refundable deposit. All stated prices are in EUR and include VAT. The current preorder window closes on 31 January 2027 for our first production run of 400 units, which ship from March 2027. Your deposit remains fully refundable until your dispatch date is confirmed. The remaining balance falls due upon final delivery date confirmation prior to dispatch and morning site installation.',
	'kea959b8a' => 'Cooking over charcoal for twelve seats produces stubborn grease on small plates and metal skewers. The high-temperature rinse clears our heavy prep dishes in ninety seconds, letting us reset our small grill station without hand-scrubbing in a cramped sink.',
	'keadd58b9' => '(04) Two sizes',
	'keb4895eb' => 'Kitchen operators and hospitality architects are welcome to inspect working machines at our Rotterdam workshop by advance appointment. From Rotterdam Centraal station, take tram line 7 or 8 heading toward the historic harbour district and alight at the riverfront quayside stop. Walk two blocks west along the canal basin to the brick industrial yard at Werfstraat 12, where our ground-floor testing counter is marked with the Susugi Wash nameplate. Please email in advance so a fitter can run a live wash cycle.',
	'keb8eb8f0' => 'The dessert spoons and final wine glasses arrive at the wash station, where the first rack slides directly into the pre-heated chamber.',
	'kebd882ba' => 'preorder window closes',
	'kec1cafc5' => 'Fitting slots Mon–Sat 06:30–11:00 &nbsp;·&nbsp; €240 &nbsp;·&nbsp; About 4 hours',
	'kecc6ad35' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Preorder (01) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Price list',
	'keda6e71c' => 'Susugi Wash',
	'kedb25d60' => 'The machine runs at 52 dB(A). The pump sits in acoustic insulation and the knee-height door closes on a soft friction hinge, so it suits a room where guests sit within reach of the pass.',
	'kedb4868d' => '598 mm',
	'kee4281ea' => 'March 2027',
	'kee56835e' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; Privacy (—) &nbsp;/&nbsp; Privacy',
	'keec6c4bd' => 'Height',
	'keef0169a' => 'Four Core Features for Busy Service',
	'kef5dc2f2' => '448 mm',
	'kefed493d' => 'Co-founder, engineering',
	'kf05b2c82' => 'Tomás Reyes',
	'kf1f6006c' => 'We maintain a strict policy against selling, renting, or disclosing customer details to external marketing agencies or commercial databases. Your contact details are stored securely within European infrastructure in compliance with statutory privacy regulations. You may request the review, amendment, or total deletion of your personal records at any time by contacting our support team at hello@susugiwash.example. If you cancel your waitlist entry or deposit reservation, your contact records are cleared from our communication registry upon request.',
	'kf26dac8a' => '(07) About',
	'kf2f7ee55' => 'The people behind the machine',
	'kf3a9c533' => '(07) Specs and prices',
	'kf3c6aa37' => 'Jun Park',
	'kf4c6f851' => 'Notes',
	'kf521d007' => 'Every piece of dinnerware in your kitchen has a dedicated place in our modular rack system, keeping fragile glass safe and heavy steel secure throughout the wash.',
	'kf5a884fe' => '(03) People',
	'kf5f14661' => 'Leeds',
	'kf6d05e1f' => 'Susugi Wash &nbsp;/&nbsp; 404 &nbsp;/&nbsp; Not found',
	'kf6ebdc52' => 'Preorder open',
	'kf7f46bc3' => 'Rack',
	'kf8192d4a' => 'Support Mon–Fri 08:00–18:00 CET',
	'kf87c4411' => 'Chef-owner, Comptoir Lea (10 seats)',
	'kf8c3f25c' => '(04) The fitters',
	'kf9bfd36b' => 'Our team combines engineering precision, field installation craft, and day-to-day culinary practice. Ines Aalders oversees product design in Rotterdam, focusing on tactile controls and enclosure geometry. Tomás Reyes leads engineering in Rotterdam, directing hydraulics, thermal control, and pump acoustics. Grace Mensah acts as head fitter, establishing installation protocols across partner cities, supported by field fitter Jun Park. Our initial development drew on direct trial evaluations with chef-owner Lea Fournier of Comptoir Lea in Lyon, cook Samir Haddad of Haddad Grill Counter in Leeds, and owner Nora Lindgren of Bar Ö in Malmö.',
	'kfaaaccf9' => 'How fitting day works →',
	'kfb4c6910' => 'Within seven days of your reservation, we review your counter height, cold water supply, and drainage line during a brief twenty-minute video consultation to ensure everything matches our installation specifications before delivery day.',
	'kfc8c60de' => 'Susugi Wash B.V. respects your privacy and handles your operational and contact data with complete confidentiality. We never sell or exchange customer information.',
